# NRA-IDE Cursor Bootstrap Rules

## Bootstrap — execute before any other action, without exception

1. Open `AGENTS.md` and read it in full.
2. Do not inspect, edit, generate, execute, or modify any project file before completing step 1.
3. After loading `AGENTS.md`, state "AGENTS.md loaded" explicitly at the start of your first reply.
4. If `AGENTS.md` cannot be found or fully loaded, stop. Do not proceed by inference.
5. Never guess the content of `AGENTS.md` from prior knowledge, conversation history, or another file. Read the file itself, now.

This file only defines the Cursor bootstrap point.
The common operating contract belongs in `AGENTS.md`.
Add Cursor-specific technical notes here only when they are necessary.